# The summon and the book's mastery in one. Three strikes on three enemies every
# three seconds: 3030ms in the client, the same clock as Ifrit and Bahamut.
#
# It freezes what it hits, as GMS says outright, which keeps a boss frozen all
# fight: three seconds between pulses against eight seconds of ice. GMS states
# no duration for it, so it uses the family's.
#
# Its 70% mastery plus the magician's own 25% makes 95%, where every 4th job
# mastery ends. Spell Mastery keeps its page but stops counting: a character
# uses the better of two masteries, never their sum.
name: "Elquines"
description:
  "Summon Elquines. Elquines can attack multiple enemies at once. Attacks "
  "from Elquines freeze enemies. Permanently increases Spell Mastery."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_ICE
freeze_seconds: 8.0
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 20
exceeds_master_level: true
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Spell Mastery"
  level: 10
}
max_enemies: 3
lines: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 3.0
base {
  skill_pct: 0.70
  mastery: 0.51
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.03
  mastery: 0.01
}
